  "description": "So-hyeon Lee, is a high school girl who is addicted to the otome romance and fostering simulation game ‘Take Care of the Princess’. While crossing a crosswalk and playing a game and is hit by a truck. \n\nWhere I woke up again... The Princess Tianir's room in the game 'Take care of the princess'! To be the kind, good, smart, and most beloved princess, I will live like this for the rest of my life! But wait, why does everyone have a bad look at me? The princess who thought she was a good protagonist is actually a villainess who boasts her best acting skills?! She can never live as a villainess. So-hyun Lee, who has become a Tianir, decides to transform her image of a villainess...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=794779), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8368913)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/LOVE/yuanlaishienv/list?title_no=2013), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/western-palace/villainess-princess/list?title_no=4045), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romantic-fantasy/princess-villain/list?title_no=3678), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/fantasy/princess-villain/list?title_no=3838), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002306)",
